/-
ToeFormal/Derivation/QFTGRMinimalWorkingModelRefinementPacketAfterConservationRetest

Lean-side marker for the QFT-GR minimal working model post-retest refinement
packet. The packet consumes the accepted inconclusive conservation-retest
attempt result review and prepares only a bounded refinement plan identifying
weak pairing domain, regularity assumptions, test-function class, candidate
source definition, and scope restriction dimensions for the toy candidate. It
does not execute refinement, rerun conservation, claim source admissibility,
prove conservation, construct a conservation proof object or witness, claim
Bianchi compatibility, derive the semiclassical Einstein equation, close
QFT-GR, validate empirically, authorize public submission, or promote the
master action.
-/

